1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:03,136
(Penny:)The one with the frogs.

2
00:00:03,305 --> 00:00:07,605
(Penny:)It was pretty cool. A lot of the girls
threw up. I gutted that thing like a deer.

3
00:00:07,768 --> 00:00:10,608
No. I'm sorry, Penny. I don't think so.

4
00:00:10,771 --> 00:00:13,561
Oh, come on, a smart guy like you?
It'll be a challenge.

5
00:00:13,732 --> 00:00:16,522
You could make it like an experiment.

6
00:00:17,403 --> 00:00:19,403
(Leonard:)Interesting.

7
00:00:19,571 --> 00:00:24,121
(Sheldon:)I suppose if someone could teach
sign language to Koko the gorilla...

8
00:00:24,785 --> 00:00:27,165
(Sheldon:)...I could teach you
some rudimentary physics.

9
00:00:27,329 --> 00:00:31,419
Great. It's a little insulting, but great.
I'll be Koko.

10
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:34,503
Mm. Not likely. Koko learned to understand
over 2000 words.

11
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:37,920
(Sheldon:)Not one of which
had anything to do with shoes.

12
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:43,177
(Howard:)Hey, fellas,
this is my girlfriend, Bernadette.

13
00:00:43,345 --> 00:00:45,685
(Howard(arriving):)My girlfriend, Bernadette.

14
00:00:46,056 --> 00:00:48,306
(Bernadette:)-Who are all those people?
-I have no idea.

15
00:00:49,768 --> 00:00:51,768
(Penny:)-Hey, Leonard.
-Hi.

16
00:00:51,937 --> 00:00:54,437
(Leonard:)Look, it's Howard
and his girlfriend, Bernadette.

17
00:00:54,606 --> 00:00:57,946
(Howard:)Thought I'd give the little woman
a tour of the old salt mines. Heh.

18
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:04,020
(Bernadette:)He doesn't mean salt mines.
He means where he works.

